{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine provides two ways to install Ada Script plugins:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Automatic discovery","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" embeds every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file in an executable target at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build time and generates one plugin backed by one target-level script module."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Manual loading"}]},{"type":"text","text":" creates an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" from source text or a file URL at runtime."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEditor-created projects use automatic discovery. Use manual loading when scripts live outside the Swift target, come from a downloaded package, or need explicit error handling."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Create-a-script","text":"Create a script","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add ","type":"text"},{"code":"Movement.ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" anywhere below the executable target’s source directory, for example:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Sources\/MyGame\/","├── main.swift","└── Scripts\/","    └── Movement.ada"],"syntax":"text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Declare a system and its query with annotations:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform)","    var transforms;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in transforms) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            position[0] += 100 * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine discovers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@system"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@query"},{"type":"text","text":" metadata and calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(context)"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever the selected scheduler runs."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Enable automatic discovery","anchor":"Enable-automatic-discovery"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Expose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin"},{"text":" to your executable target in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ swift-tools-version: 6.2","import PackageDescription","","let package = Package(","    name: \"MyGame\",","    platforms: [","        .macOS(.v15)","    ],","    dependencies: [","        .package(","            url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/AdaEngine\/AdaEngine.git\",","            branch: \"main\"","        )","    ],","    targets: [","        .executableTarget(","            name: \"MyGame\",","            dependencies: [","                .product(name: \"AdaEngine\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ],","            plugins: [","                .plugin(name: \"AdaScriptBuildPlugin\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ]","        )","    ]",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose a version requirement appropriate for your project instead of a branch dependency when consuming a released AdaEngine version."}]}],"style":"important","name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The build plugin finds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" files through SwiftPM, sorts them by target-relative"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path, and generates "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptPluginsGenerated.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" in the plugin work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directory. The generated plugin passes one source map to one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Script source is embedded in the executable; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original files are not read at runtime."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the generated plugin in your app scene:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import AdaEngine","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(AdaScriptPluginsGenerated())","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rebuilding the target after adding, removing, renaming, or editing an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file refreshes the generated source."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a portable AdaScript project running in AdaEditor’s macOS game window, edits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" files hot reload after a short pause, including unsaved editor buffers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The current ECS world remains active. A failed candidate leaves the last valid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code running and reports the error in Output. System instances and ordinary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"script globals restart, and startup systems run once for the new version;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exported scriptable-object fields survive. Changes to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component, resource, network, or scriptable-object schemas require restarting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the game."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The same generated source contains native backing structs and registration for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scalar ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@component"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@resource"},{"text":" declarations. Because these declarations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change Swift layout, adding or editing their stored fields requires rebuilding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the target rather than source-only reload.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Register custom components","anchor":"Register-custom-components"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ada Script resolves component names while plugins are set up. Register custom Swift components before the generated script plugin:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import AdaEngine","","@Component","struct Movement: Codable, Sendable {","    var velocity: Vector2","}","","struct GameComponentsPlugin: Plugin {","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        Movement.registerComponent()","    }","}","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(","            GameComponentsPlugin(),","            AdaScriptPluginsGenerated()","        )","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" macro supplies field reflection for supported property types. A plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Component"},{"type":"text","text":" can participate in query matching, but its fields are not automatically available through the script bridge."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Load-a-script-manually","text":"Load a script manually","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" when you need control over the source location or loading failure:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","struct RuntimeScriptsPlugin: Plugin {","    let scriptURL: URL","","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        do {","            let script = try AdaScriptPlugin(contentsOf: scriptURL)","            app.addPlugin(script)","        } catch {","            print(\"Could not load Ada Script: \\(error)\")","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" when one source is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already in memory, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptPlugin\/init(sources:name:)"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" values for a multi-file module. Script compilation,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"import resolution, and annotation validation happen during initialization.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Native component resolution happens later during plugin setup.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","text":"Next steps"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for annotation syntax, then "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for queries, component fields, and native iterator behavior."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with Ada Script"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script."}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin/init(source:name:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"convenience"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"source"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"role":"symbol","title":"init(source:name:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptplugin\/init(source:name:)","abstract":[]},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptBasics":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn the syntax of Ada Script before connecting a script to a scene or ECS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world. Ada Script files use the "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extension. The examples on this page are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"small pieces you can combine in one file; a game does not need a "},{"code":"main()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"function. Start with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript"},{"type":"text","text":" to run a complete system."}],"role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"Ada Script Basics","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptbasics"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptECS":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare annotation-driven systems and iterate native AdaECS component columns."}],"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptecs","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","title":"Ada Script ECS","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLanguage":{"type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","title":"Ada Script Language","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlanguage","abstract":[{"text":"Use Ada Script syntax with AdaEngine declaration annotations. New to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language? Start with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics"},{"text":" for values, functions, types,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties, control flow, asynchronous work, and annotations.","type":"text"}]},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptSource":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AdaScriptSource","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdaScriptSource","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AdaScriptSource","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptsource","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One source file embedded in an Ada Script module."}]},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLibraries":{"kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Share reusable AdaScript functions, systems, and scriptable objects through a GitHub repository.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"AdaEditor installs the library and its transitive dependencies into the project. Run, Play Mode,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Preview, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin"},{"text":" load the same installed sources without network access.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlibraries","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries","title":"AdaScript Libraries"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/GettingStartedWithAdaScript":{"title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script."}],"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptAnnotations":{"title":"Ada Script Annotation Reference","abstract":[{"text":"Choose an annotation by the declaration it describes. Annotation arguments","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are literals, identifiers, or lists of those values, not runtime expressions.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The same spelling can have different roles: ","type":"text"},{"code":"@component","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" declares a struct,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while ","type":"text"},{"code":"@component(required: true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" binds an existing component to a scriptable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptannotations","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting","title":"Ada Script","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting","abstract":[{"text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS.","type":"text"}]},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Loads an annotation-driven Ada Script module."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptplugin","title":"AdaScriptPlugin","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AdaScriptPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdaScriptPlugin","kind":"identifier"}]}}}